{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 364 days before the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D6"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Chloroprocaine hydrochloride is not on FDA's current shortage list as of 2026-10-21; FDA's history shows an earlier shortage first posted on 2021-05-17, since resolved.",
      "cites": ["D10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1123748 at Fresenius Kabi USA LLC ended 2020-05-18 and was classified OAI with a classification letter dated 2024-05-22, 364 days before the shortage posting on 2021-05-17.",
      "cites": ["D6", "E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A second FDA inspection 1174894 at the same plant ended 2022-06-30 and was classified OAI with a classification letter dated 2024-04-30, 409 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D7", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The most recent inspection 1216183 at Fresenius Kabi USA LLC ended 2023-08-24 and was classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our 20 mg/mL 20 mL vial supply (NDC 00143920910) is labeled Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. and manufactured at HIKMA FARMACÊUTICA (PORTUGAL).",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2", "E4", "E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 8.1 days on hand, Corvale Lakeside has 18 days, and Corvale General has 15 days for this presentation.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked option is to transfer 2 vials of 20 mg/mL 20 mL from Corvale Lakeside to Corvale East, which would leave Lakeside with 15 days and bring East to 9 days.",
      "cites": ["D11"]
    }
  ]
}
